@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@walletID = 01a150e5-b5e1-726b-8b30-56ccdbb596e6

### Создать кошелёк — 201, balance = 0
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallet
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currency": "RUB"
}

### Получить баланс — 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets/{{walletID}}

### Пополнить на 100 RUB — 200, APPLIED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: deposit-key-1

{
  "walletId": "{{walletID}}",
  "operationType": "DEPOSIT",
  "amount": 10000
}

### Списать 25 RUB — 200, APPLIED
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: withdraw-key-1

{
  "walletId": "{{walletID}}",
  "operationType": "WITHDRAW",
  "amount": 2500
}

### Списать больше остатка — 422, REJECTED, INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: withdraw-key-2

{
  "walletId": "{{walletID}}",
  "operationType": "WITHDRAW",
  "amount": 1000000
}

### Проверить итоговый баланс — 200, balance = 7500
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets/{{walletID}}

### Запрос без ключа идемпотентности — 400, MISSING_IDEMPOTENCY_KEY
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletId": "{{walletID}}",
  "operationType": "DEPOSIT",
  "amountMinor": 100
}

### Нулевая сумма — 400, INVALID_AMOUNT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: {{$uuid}}

{
  "walletId": "{{walletID}}",
  "operationType": "DEPOSIT",
  "amount": 0
}

### Несуществующий кошелёк — 404, WALLET_NOT_FOUND
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets/01900000-0000-7000-8000-000000000000

### Некорректный UUID — 400, INVALID_WALLET_ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/wallets/not-a-uuid
